        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Until a certain period of time has passed after the first regulatory approval of the Licensed Product, we are prohibited from commercializing certain competing products worldwide and Kissei is prohibited from researching, developing or commercializing certain competing products worldwide.",
