        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have established in-house chemistry, manufacturing and controls (CMC) expertise made up of individuals with oncolytic immunotherapy manufacturing experience, enhanced by an advisory board to help oversee our overall CMC strategic focus, while leveraging third parties for product manufacturing.",
